 '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-16T02:38:42.496Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"f5ddedf1-d778-4d07-9981-0283469c6afa","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt_id":"f5ddedf1-d778-4d07-9981-0283469c6afa","session_id":"d17d5fbc-bb52-45ce-8162-fcf6d0ff26cb","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"2a34d1b9-6541-43bc-a3b2-8fe42719be81","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"f7ec7a6a-8da4-47ce-81ee-28fa504f5493","thread":"2a34d1b9-6541-43bc-a3b2-8fe42719be81","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-f7ec7a6a-8da4-47ce-81ee-28fa504f5493"},"workspace":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/t82-gfv1w8wo/f0/c-h9g_m2l0/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261016-1-a1","base_commit":"954845c8aa03ad2683fd151f9cba8a3a2100ce1a","card_snapshot_id":"0e6e9ec4-6bce-4feb-87e0-a89a0593c83e","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261016-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-16T02:38:43.783Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"f5ddedf1-d778-4d07-9981-0283469c6afa","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/Volumes/WD-Elements/t82-gfv1w8wo/f0/c-h9g_m2l0/repo","cat-file","-t","0674ec7b4b556a07fb3f8d8e58b334cddb8732ad"],"cwd":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/t82-gfv1w8wo/f0/c-h9g_m2l0/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-16T02:38:43.789Z","task":"fixture-20261016-1","attempt":"f5ddedf1-d778-4d07-9981-0283469c6afa","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/Volumes/WD-Elements/t82-gfv1w8wo/f0/c-h9g_m2l0/repo","cat-file","-t","0674ec7b4b556a07fb3f8d8e58b334cddb8732ad"],"cwd":"/Volumes/WD-Elements/t82-gfv1w8wo/f0/c-h9g_m2l0/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":3